# Usefulness: Standardizing CIRCULARITY ensures it contributes proportionately to the model, preventing domination by other features with higher variances or scales. This is particularly important since CIRCULARITY has a relatively smaller range.

df['CIRCULARITY_ZSCORE'] = (df['CIRCULARITY'] - df['CIRCULARITY'].mean()) / df['CIRCULARITY'].std()
end

